OL,3,GNEWSAGunman who shot two men in head
OL,4,Aguilty of murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who fatally shot two people in a
OL,7,Fcar has been convicted of their
OL,8,Fmurders.
OL,10,FMohammed Maneer Khan, 39, shot Duaine
OL,11,FMills and Syed Zain Ali in the head as
OL,12,Fthey tried to drive off in an Audi A4,
OL,13,Fseconds after the victims had
OL,14,F"attacked" a parked Audi RS6 with a bar
OL,15,Fand a hammer in Wolverhampton, the
OL,16,Fcity's Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
