OL,3,GNEWSAGunman who shot two men in head
OL,4,Aguilty of murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FMills, 28, died at the scene and Ali,
OL,7,F32, died in hospital from an
OL,8,F"unsurvivable" brain injury five days
OL,9,Fafter the shooting in the Whitmore
OL,10,FReans area of the city on 19 September
OL,11,F2025.
OL,13,FKhan, of Great Hampton Street,
OL,14,FWolverhampton, will be sentenced on 18
OL,15,FDecember.
